                          <div class="read-more-target coursesummary" style="-webkit-box-orient: vertical;"><p dir="ltr" style="text-align: left;">A recruitment and selection course provides an overview of the strategies and practices necessary for attracting and hiring the best talent. This course covers the recruitment process, job analysis, candidate sourcing, interviewing techniques, and the legal considerations involved in hiring. It aims to equip participants with the skills to align recruitment practices with organizational goals, optimize the candidate experience, and make informed selection decisions, ensuring that the right people are hired for the right roles. Through this course, learners gain insights into effective communication with candidates, the use of technology in recruitment, and the importance of diversity and inclusion in the hiring process.<br></p>
